-- spoiler follows --

Unicorn horns -- should be (a)pplied for best results.  For more
frequent best results, bless the thing first.  For sometimes
desirable bad results, curse it.  To see clearly what this means,
try doing the former when confused and the latter when in danger
of petrification.  I'm full of admiration that you could get so far
in the game without so essential a tool.  BTW, an enhanced blessed
unicorn horn makes a decent backup weapon.  Also, try #dipping your
unicorn horn into stuff.  Takes persistence, but the results can be
worthwhile.
  
Crysknives -- this took me a long time, too.  But a blessed wormtooth
changes its nature when enhanced.


